This tricky little dwarf is quite interested in you!  To be exact, he would like to see what items of value you may be carrying.	這個狡猾的小矮人對你很感興趣！說得精確一點，他想瞧瞧你身上帶著什麼值錢的東西。
Looks like the dwarf is running off.  Did he take anything?	矮人似乎要逃跑了。他有沒有拿走什麼東西？
Talking to this dwarf is a waste of breath.  He's only interested in what you've got in your pockets.	跟這矮人講話只是白費唇舌，他只在乎你口袋裡裝了什麼。
The dwarf is too fast for you to catch.	矮人的動作太快，你追不上他。
The dwarf, startled by your sudden disappearance, runs away.	矮人被你突然消失的舉動嚇了一跳，拔腿逃走了。
You don't see the %s	你沒看見%s
You're not close enough.	你離得不夠近。
The %s looks like any other %s.	%s看起來就和其他%s一樣。
The %s will not move.	%s不會動。
You cannot get the %s.	你沒辦法拿取%s。
You cannot open the %s.	你沒辦法打開%s。
You cannot close the %s.	你沒辦法關閉%s。
The %s has no smell.	%s沒有味道。
You cannot move the %s.	你沒辦法移動%s。
You wouldn't want to eat the %s.	你不會想吃%s。
You can't climb the %s.	你沒辦法爬上%s。
The %s has nothing to say.	%s沒什麼好說的。
You're not facing the %s.	你沒有面對著%s。
