File: %s	檔案：%s
Your save game disk is full. You must either use another disk or save over an existing saved game.	你的存檔磁片已滿。你必須換一張磁片，或覆蓋現有的存檔。
That game was saved under a different interpreter. It cannot be restored.	這個存檔是用不同的直譯器儲存的，無法讀取。
I don't understand "%s".	我聽不懂「%s」。
That doesn't appear to be a proper sentence.	這句話看起來不太像個完整的句子。
That sentence doesn't make sense.	這句話沒有意義。
You've left me responseless.	你讓我無言以對。
Please insert your %s disk in drive %s.	請將你的 %s 磁片插入 %s 磁碟機。
