DURING THE GAME:  ESC opens and closes the menus,    which show additional shortcuts.  IN DIALOG WINDOWS:  Your current choice is outlined.  Tab and Shift-Tab move between    choices.  ESC always cancels.  IN TYPING WINDOWS:  Arrows, Home, and End move the    cursor.  Ctrl-C clears the line.	遊戲中：\n ESC 開關選單。\n對話視窗：\n 目前選項有外框。\n Tab／Shift-Tab 換選項，ESC 取消。\n輸入時：\n 方向鍵、Home、End 移游標。\n Ctrl-C 清整行。
You are unable to duck here.	你在這裡沒辦法蹲下。
You have no reason to duck - nobody can see you while you're invisible.	你沒有理由蹲下——你隱形的時候沒有人看得到你。
You can't jump here.	你在這裡沒辦法跳躍。
Very well, I shall wait until you are ready to resume our adventure again.	好吧，我會等你準備好，再繼續我們的冒險。
This is not a good time to rummage through your belongings.  Try again a little later.	現在不是翻找你隨身物品的好時機。晚一點再試試看。
You are ducking.	你正蹲著。
You'll have to try that when you're on your feet.	你得先站起來才能這麼做。
As you jump, the ring slips off your finger, and you are visible again.	你跳起來的時候，戒指從手指上滑落，你又現出原形了。
As you jump, the ring slips off your finger.	你跳起來的時候，戒指從手指上滑落了。
