King's Quest I	國王密令 I
 Dagger 	 短刀 
This is a fine silver dagger, with a very sharp edge!	這是一把精美的銀製短刀，刀刃十分鋒利！
 Chest 	 金盒子 
This Magic chest, one of the three lost treasures of Daventry, is always filled with gold coins.	這只金盒子是戴凡確王國失落的三件寶物之一，裡頭永遠裝滿了金幣。
 Carrot 	 胡蘿蔔 
This looks like an ordinary carrot.	這看起來是一根普通的胡蘿蔔。
This is a simple gold key.	這是一把樸素的金鑰匙。
There is a message written on the note: "Sometimes it is wise to think backwards."	紙條上寫著一段話：「有時候，反過來想才是明智之舉。」
 Magic Ring 	 魔戒 
Your hand tingles slightly as you look at this jewelled ring.	你看著這枚鑲著寶石的戒指，手心微微感到一陣刺麻。
 Four-leaf Clover 	 幸運草 
You are holding a large four-leaf clover.	你手裡拿著一株碩大的幸運草。
 Ceramic Bowl 	 陶碗 
Inscribed on the inside of this empty ceramic bowl is the word "Fill."	這只空陶碗內側刻著「裝滿」兩個字。
 Empty Water Bucket 	 空水桶 
You are holding an empty wooden bucket.	你手裡拿著一個空的木桶。
 Pebbles 	 鵝卵石 
You have a pocketful of smooth, rounded pebbles.	你口袋裡裝滿了光滑圓潤的鵝卵石。
 Leather Slingshot 	 皮製投石器 
This is a small but sturdy slingshot.	這是一把小巧但堅固的投石器。
 Pouch 	 皮袋 
You are holding a plain leather pouch.	你手裡拿著一只樸素的皮袋。
 Sceptre 	 王杖 
This jewelled sceptre belongs to the King of the Leprechauns.	這根鑲滿寶石的王杖，屬於地穴人國王所有。
 Cheese 	 乳酪 
This is an extremely fragrant piece of Swiss cheese.	這是一塊香氣濃郁的瑞士乳酪。
 Magic Mirror 	 魔鏡 
This is the magic mirror, one of the three treasures of Daventry.	這面魔鏡是戴凡確王國三件寶物之一。
 Gold Egg 	 金蛋 
You are holding a lovely golden egg.	你手裡拿著一顆美麗的金蛋。
 Magic Shield 	 靈盾 
This is the magic shield, one of the three treasures of Daventry.	這面靈盾是戴凡確王國三件寶物之一。
 Fiddle 	 小提琴 
This is the woodcutter's old fiddle.	這是樵夫的那把舊小提琴。
You are holding an ordinary walnut.	你手裡拿著一顆普通的胡桃。
 Mushroom 	 蘑菇 
This is a small, unusual-looking mushroom.	這是一朵外形奇特的小蘑菇。
 Beans 	 豆子 
You are holding a handful of small beans.	你手裡拿著一把小豆子。
 Full Water Bucket 	 裝滿水的水桶 
This old wooden bucket is now filled with clear water.	這個老舊的木桶現在裝滿了清水。
Restore	讀取
