Ripple	漣漪
A sturdy bridge has been built here to span the moat.	這裡架著一座堅固的橋樑，橫跨護城河。
Massive turrets, from which the guards can defend the castle, stretch to the sky above.	巨大的城樓高聳入雲，衛兵可以在上頭防守城堡。
The trees around the castle are tall and old; they were just as tall back when King Edward was just a young prince!	城堡四周的樹木高大又古老；早在愛德華國王還是個年輕王子的時候，它們就已經一樣高聳了！
The moving rock rolls downhill...and right into you.   A crushing defeat.	這顆會滾動的石頭滾下山坡……正好撞上你。這是一場毀滅性的失敗。
This rock is less distinctive than the one next to it.	這顆石頭沒有它旁邊那顆來得顯眼。
There is a dense grove of trees here.	這裡有一片茂密的樹林。
This is a serene mountain lake with a small beach of pebbles on its edge.	這是一座寧靜的山中湖泊，湖畔有一小片鵝卵石灘。
On the beach are some smooth pebbles.	灘上有一些光滑的鵝卵石。
There are many lush trees surrounding the lake.	湖泊四周長滿了茂盛的樹木。
An old, dignified oak tree rests near the shore of the lake.	一棵古老而莊嚴的橡樹，靜靜佇立在湖畔附近。
big rock	大石頭
The roots of the oak are entwined around this craggy cluster of rocks.	橡樹的樹根盤繞著這叢嶙峋的岩石。
small rock	小石頭
A boulder sits at the side of lake, the water lapping gently against its sides.	一塊巨石座落在湖邊，湖水輕輕拍打著它的側面。
The roots of the oak spread out here to soak up water from the moist earth.	橡樹的樹根在這裡向外伸展，從濕潤的泥土中吸收水分。
A totally typical example of the trees in this forest.	這是這片森林裡再典型不過的一棵樹。
You've found a bush, but there isn't a quail in the game.	你發現了一叢灌木，不過遊戲裡並沒有鵪鶉。
A distinctively common tree sits near the shore of the lake.	一棵格外平凡的樹，佇立在湖畔附近。
large_tree	large_tree
large_tree1	large_tree1
large_tree2	large_tree2
large_tree3	large_tree3
large_tree4	large_tree4
large_tree5	large_tree5
You can just see the northern edge of a nearby lake.	你隱約能看見附近湖泊的北緣。
There's a single large rock sitting off to the side.	一旁孤零零地擺著一塊大石頭。
A majestic old tree stands nearby.	附近矗立著一棵雄偉的老樹。
This is a beautiful little lake.	這是一座美麗的小湖。
small tree	小樹
This is just one of the many small trees adorning Daventry's countryside.	這只是戴凡確王國鄉間，眾多點綴景色的小樹之一。
